I like wishing for "blessed +3 gauntlets of power," "blessed +3 gray dragon 
scale mail," or "blessed +3 warhammer named Mjollnir."

I like gauntlets of power most since they allow you to do great damage, 
carry lots o' stuff, and lowers your AC by 4.  It is a toss up between gray 
dragon scale mail or Mjollnir; if you already have a good weapon, get the 
armor.  It is AWESOME armor.  If you don't have a decent weapon, maybe 
Mjollnir, Stormbringer, or Excalibur would be nice.  I usually create 
Excalibur during the game, so I would take the armor.






